// 九尾狐 on all fours, for the skinned-mesh spike: a white fox spirit,
// drawn the way chibi kitsune are. A round, short-legged body; a round,
// cat-like face with a short muzzle, big eyes with a pink iris, red
// eyeliner, a red flame on the forehead (painted, face.rs) and two red
// stripes on each cheek; big rounded ears red from the tip down, flaring
// cheek tufts, a fluffy ruff and a tuft on the throat, a red cord with a
// gold bell; and nine little flame tails opening behind like the petals of
// a flower, white through pink to red, flickering as they sway.
// The tails come from gen_tails.py: change them there and paste the
// output back in.
